## The brief
C. Morgan Pallets is a family-run pallet supplier based in Bargoed, covering South Wales with new, reconditioned, and bespoke pallets plus a collection and buy-back service. They wanted a proper website that set out everything they do and made it easy for new customers to get in touch — something that would bring in more enquiries rather than just sit there.

## What we built
- A clear, fast website structured around each service: pallet supply, recycling and collection, bespoke pallets, and ISPM 15 heat treating for export
- A dedicated pallet types page so customers can identify exactly what they need before enquiring
- An "areas we cover" section targeting the towns across South Wales they deliver to
- Prominent "Get a quote" calls to action on every page, with a simple enquiry form

## What's included
- New website — designed, built, and launched
- Local SEO foundations targeting pallet supplier searches across South Wales
- Hosting and ongoing site management handled by NC Digital

## Results
- A professional platform that presents the full range of services in one place
- Built to rank for local pallet searches and convert visitors into quote requests

NC Digital builds [lead-generating websites](/services/web-design/) for suppliers and trade businesses across South Wales, with [web development](/services/web-development/) and hosting included.
